I have great friends around me who,

00:10:27.008 --> 00:10:30.718
I don't shun their advice, you know,

00:10:30.718 --> 00:10:34.322
I encourage their advice, which
I think is very important.

00:10:34.322 --> 00:10:36.645
You can live in your own,
alternative universe,

00:10:36.645 --> 00:10:40.108
with how people treat
celebrity these days,

00:10:40.108 --> 00:10:43.465
but as long as you keep
good friends around you.

00:10:43.465 --> 00:10:46.069
And also not puttin' yourself in a box

00:10:46.069 --> 00:10:47.949
and becoming a prisoner of your fame.

00:10:47.949 --> 00:10:49.800
A lot of people, once they become famous,

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.083
they stop doin' things that they did.

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:53.094
They don't go to the store, or,

00:10:53.094 --> 00:10:54.996
you become a prisoner of your fame,

00:10:54.996 --> 00:10:59.540
and I've always been aware
and cognizant of that,

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:02.047
not to let that, allow
that to happen to me.

